 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Referral Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a referral form?\", \"a\": \"A referral form is the document one person fills in to send someone to another person or service. Doctors use it to send a patient to a specialist, and employers use it to collect names from staff. It records who is referred, who is referring and why.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create referral forms online?\", \"a\": \"List the people who refer to you and the person who handles each case. Describe your referral forms in a prompt to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>. You get a working form with a table of every referral and the alerts each handler needs, and you change any part later by asking.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a patient referral form?\", \"a\": \"It is what a doctor's office sends when a patient needs a specialist or a service it does not offer. It names the patient, the two providers and the reason for referral, often with recent notes attached. Many HMO plans will not pay for a specialist visit without one. Most of the patient details come from the clinic's own patient intake form.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a teacher referral form?\", \"a\": \"A teacher referral form asks a school's student support team or counselor to look at a student's needs. The teacher describes the concern, such as falling grades or missed classes, and lists the supports already tried in class. The team reviews it and agrees on a plan with the teacher.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can you provide an example of a referral form?\", \"a\": \"Here is one a clinic would use. The referring office enters the patient's name and insurance plan, then the referring doctor and a reason in plain words, such as chest pain on exertion. It attaches the latest visit note and checks a box for routine or urgent. A hiring version asks for the role and a resume instead, and the candidate later completes a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/job-application-form'>job application form</a>.\"}, {\"q\": \"How to fill out the referral form?\", \"a\": \"Start with your own details as the referrer, then the person you are referring and how to reach them. State the reason in one or two specific sentences. Attach what the form asks for, such as notes or a resume, and mark it urgent only when it is.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do referral forms look like?\", \"a\": \"Most fit on one page. The top holds the referring party and the person referred, the middle asks for the reason and the urgency, and the bottom carries attachments with a signature or date. A referral form pdf has the same layout, but someone has to retype every answer.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I turn a paper referral form into an online form?\", \"a\": \"Start from the paper version's fields, in the order referring offices already know. Mark which ones are required and add an upload for the notes people used to staple on. Decide who receives each submission, then send referrers the link in place of the fax number. With Emergent, every referral becomes a row in a database you own, with no cap on how many arrive.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a referral form template include?\", \"a\": \"At minimum, the referrer's name and contact details, the person referred, the reason, and a date. Beyond that, add only what the receiving side acts on. A trucking company wants the driver's license class, while a refer-a-friend program needs little more than the friend's email and the sender's code.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a free referral form template?\", \"a\": \"Form builders and template sites each publish a referral form template to copy. A template hands you the fields, but it cannot put an urgent case first or tell the sender what happened. Emergent builds the working version from a prompt and is free to start.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}